// reference, and the generated reference pages in the order the tier's own
// --help lists them.
//
// Every tier section has the same skeleton: an overview, then Getting started,
// Guides, Observability, Reference, and a troubleshooting page. A new tier
// (training, when it is documented) copies the shape and adds one navbar item
// in docusaurus.config.js; nothing else depends on the number of sections.
//
// Getting started is the one category open on a first visit; the others are
// collapsed so the sidebar shows the shape of the section rather than every
